  "behavior": [
    "InventoryGrid.toValue calls the native producer directly once and adopts its single owned xvalue* result as var, without an intermediate text buffer or deep copy.",
    "XUI produces independent layout, color, interaction, gamepad and slot data. Resource fields contribute metadata. A previously exported tree survives mutation of the grid and close of its context.",
    "Allocation failure at each measured prefix is checked, preserves the previous language result, and restores the tracked heap counters. Invalidated widget access fails checked.",
    "Allocation counts compare 50 warmed two-slot exports with the same native API and equivalent release in C. Native tree construction allocates. Adoption adds no measured allocations or reallocations in the comparison."
